73158,"text":"2","y":0.35901162773751882,"h":0.010174418822443076},{"h":0.013255052597745176,"w":0.39689579010009768,"text":"There's a Japanese death metal band that is playing","y":0.35883797046732735,"x":0.58093125763842135},{"y":0.37354651178217624,"x":0.58758315245603798,"h":0.011627906668205679,"w":0.18181818008422845,"text":"at the club on Saturday."},{"h":0.0087209301962594132,"y":0.40116279065768423,"text":"3","w":0.011086474657058698,"x":0.56319290468920902},{"y":0.4009819966906103,"w":0.39467849731445315,"h":0.013262189546700665,"text":"Most of the buildings that were destroyed in the war","x":0.58980044409960997},{"y":0.41407528639156421,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"have been rebuilt.","x":0.58758315550726903,"w":0.13968956947326661},{"text":"4","h":0.010174418042022126,"w":0.013303768634796209,"y":0.44186046532491918,"x":0.56319290526131593},{"y":0.44186046516772781,"w":0.4057649612426758,"h":0.013131351205604158,"text":"Pupils who live in the hills have to walk several hours","x":0.57649667004385097},{"x":0.58758315265696448,"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.12638580322265625,"y":0.45621931252661774,"text":"to get to school."},{"text":"5","y":0.4840116278766764,"w":0.013303768634796209,"h":0.0087209301962594132,"x":0.56319290526131593},{"h":0.013233642531299772,"text":"Jim finally proposed to Tina, which was what we've","x":0.576496666420379,"w":0.39467849731445315,"y":0.48240589210717388},{"x":0.58758315081350998,"w":0.15077605247497561,"text":"all been waiting for.","y":0.49709302322853222,"h":0.013136109431714726},{"x":0.54988913591102218,"h":0.013271704438080012,"y":0.54050736513862041,"w":0.26829267501831056,"text":"SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT"},{"w":0.40354766845703127,"y":0.56669394457107936,"x":0.5410199506938792,"text":"6 Choose the correct option to complete the text.","h":0.013247915648789688},{"w":0.27272726058959962,"x":0.56319291413424677,"h":0.016095421318141567,"text":"What is Generation Z?","y":0.60174418615534986},{"h":0.013243158203099958,"text":"Generation Z refers to people 'who \/ whose were born","x":0.56319291197953192,"y":0.62193126035010238,"w":0.40133037567138674},{"x":0.56319290554013801,"text":"between 1995 and 2010. They have a lot in common with","y":0.63788870700149891,"w":0.40133037567138674,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"text":"the previous generation, 2who \/ Øknown as millennials,","h":0.014729950900163713,"y":0.65098199634554177,"x":0.56319291038345765,"w":0.40354766845703127},{"x":0.56077420411595169,"h":0.013783379974614873,"text":"but they also differ in many ways","y":0.66555780640096929,"w":0.24433061599731443},{"y":0.6845335519180461,"h":0.013140866877404456,"w":0.40133037567138674,"x":0.56319290946659761,"text":"Whereas millennials are said to be idealistic, Gen Z are"},{"x":0.56319291197953192,"text":"more sensible and realistic. Theydo care aboutthe world,","y":0.69912790702819294,"w":0.40133037567138674,"h":0.013228885085610043},{"text":"but the things 3Ø \/ that really concern them are money","x":0.56319291190562193,"y":0.7122093028582186,"h":0.014534883140151944,"w":0.40133037567138674},{"x":0.56279106737567208,"y":0.72629733324761592,"h":0.013013559940793895,"w":0.091917438507080229,"text":"and security."},{"text":"Millennials do well in situations and places 4which \/","h":0.013178928784184696,"x":0.56319289874967271,"y":0.74418604632082852,"w":0.40133037567138674},{"h":0.013148003045938994,"y":0.76017441884989845,"w":0.3991130828857421,"text":"where everybody works together to achieve goals.","x":0.56319290970273106},{"text":"Gen Z, on the other hand, are independent. They want to","w":0.40133037567138674,"x":0.56319291197953192,"y":0.77325581395648757,"h":0.013159898221005051},{"y":0.78660699711098625,"text":"complete tasks on their own rather than in a team,","x":0.56303314360145507,"h":0.01579012925418033,"w":0.40169822692871093},{"y":0.80020548844875994,"text":"5that \/ which is something that makes them more","x":0.56070254263344854,"h":0.017344621511606095,"w":0.40402053833007812},{"text":"competitive. It's also the generation who \/ whose","y":0.81669394473459678,"h":0.013247915648789688,"w":0.40133037567138674,"x":0.56319291030732199},{"x":0.56319291030732199,"y":0.83139534895514133,"h":0.011627906668205679,"w":0.40133037567138674,"text":"members are more likely to start their own business"},{"h":0.011865793780687417,"x":0.5631929205819296,"text":"and succeed at an earlier age than millennials.","y":0.84574468067264696,"w":0.34146339416503901},{"h":0.013114699365269322,"y":0.86333878914311712,"w":0.40133037567138674,"x":0.56319291025188956,"text":"Do you agree with these characteristics? Do they"},{"w":0.1042128562927247,"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.87790697681124596,"x":0.56319290770729613,"text":"describe you?"},{"text":"\/6","x":0.94900221691722064,"w":0.022172949314117507,"y":0.91279069802840762,"h":0.010174418042022126},{"w":0.32372505187988287,"h":0.013183687010295264,"text":"GRAMMAR: Train and Try Again page 172","x":0.60088692357964457,"y":0.93739770852934123}]